{"title":"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f7c391fe90bba771fca68fb7263e804ee8435be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{x}}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"82\" height=\"45\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aae25812c2d102dcb408f87b840481f5442004bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{y}}}}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -32px\" width=\"120\" height=\"57\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve for each variable.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/5/fc5a521412d762cd12269197619236638cdd13d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{x}}=2\\]\" width=\"77\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd930824d4842bc690b7a6ab8056bd6303b6c545.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 = 2 + \\frac{2}{x}\\]\" width=\"75\" height=\"37\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/3/1c39bf7831201df75ea4512932893f8f4a431726.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-1 = \\frac{2}{x}\\]\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/8/488283de1634a8345d583625af8bb2f1d7c630f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{x=-2}\\]\" width=\"69\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>Now for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/9/9c96ff02aa743804eab57787491152ef84309385.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{y}}}}=2\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f697aa67c8475db9c52bf187af536786e4aa2a7f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 = 2 + \\frac{2}{1+\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{y}}}\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/5/6056df50954f5ef0fb8def912e85c7a96a1394ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-1 = + \\frac{2}{1+\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{y}}}\\]\" width=\"124\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/5/fc55502e2289b0eff7679a48f270d8a1d6a83b45.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-1 - \\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{y}} = 2\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/4/0f4e12f3dedd3f251b65689db82751e64cb6efde.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{1+\\frac{1}{y}} = -3\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/c/a9ced3e1d8e3fd1853d09494e565c33dfd782d7f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-4 = \\frac{3}{y}\\]\" width=\"58\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/b/75b428189a54740843e20577bc244d771395cb34.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{y = -\\frac{3}{4}}\\]\" width=\"72\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~IYN~\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II\">2014 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 UNCO Math Contest II Pr